 35S  c  1986Wa22: {+35}P was produced via the {+36}S(t,|a){+35}P reaction. 81% 
 35S 2c  enriched {+36}S targets were bombarded with 3.4-MeV tritons from the   
 35S 3c  Brookhaven National Laboratory (BNL) tandem van de Graaff facility. |g 
 35S 4c  rays were detected using an intrinsic coaxial Ge detector. Measured    
 35S 5c  E|g, I|g. Deduced levels, decay branching ratios, and log {Ift}.       
 35S 6c  Compared with shell model calculations.                                
 35S 7c                                                                         
 35S  c  1972Ap01: {+35}P was produced via the {+37}Cl(t,|ap){+35}P reaction.   
 35S 2c  LiCl and NaCl targets were bombarded with 16-MeV tritons from the Los  
 35S 3c  Alamos tandem Van de Graaff facility. |g rays were detected using an 85
 35S 4c  cm{+3} Ge(Li) detector. |b particles were detected using an end-window 
 35S 5c  gas-flow proportional counter. Measured E|g, I|g, and I|b. Deduced     
 35S 6c  {+35}P T{-1/2}, decay branching ratios, and log {Ift}. Compared with   
 35S 7c  shell model calculations.                                              
 35S 8c                                                                         
 35S  c  1972Go31: {+35}P was produced via the {+18}O({+19}F,2p){+35}P and      
 35S 2c  {+36}S(t,|a){+35}P reactions at the second tandem of the Brookhaven    
 35S 3c  National Laboratory (BNL) tandem van de Graaff facility. {+35}P        
 35S 4c  |b-delayed |g rays were detected using a 60 cm{+3} Ge(Li) detector. |b 
 35S 5c  particles were detected in coincidence with the 1572|g using a NE102   
 35S 6c  scintillator. Measured E|g, I|g, and E|b. Deduced {+35}P T{-1/2}, |b   
 35S 7c  end-point energy, mass, decay branching ratios, and log {Ift}. Compared
 35S 8c  with shell model calculations.                                         
 35S 9c                                                                         
 35S  c  1971Gr53: {+35}P was produced via the {+37}Cl(|g,2p){+35}P reaction.   
 35S 2c  6-g NH{-4}Cl(nat) samples were irradiated with |g rays from a          
 35S 3c  bremsstrahlung spectrum at the Mainz electron linear accelerator. |g   
 35S 4c  rays were detected using NaI(Tl) and Ge(Li) detectors. Measured E|g.   
 35S 5c  Deduced T{-1/2} of {+35}P and levels in {+35}S.                        
 35S 6c                                                                         
